ng of all the earth: sing praises with understanding."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["God reigns over the nations: God sits upon the throne of his holiness."]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["The rulers of the people are assembled with the God of Abraam: for God's mighty ones of the earth have been greatly exalted."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/46.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/47.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/45.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}